/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 42 442 [
[(The [send] and [receive] objects allow you to make non-local connections.)]
[(These work globally--you can use them to make two different patches)]
[(intercommunicate if you wish. Any message a [send] gets appears at the)]
[(output of every [receive] of the same name. There can be any number of)]
[([send] and [receive] objects sharing the same name:)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
grestore
