/Menlo-Regular findfont 12 scalefont ISOEncode setfont
0.000 0.000 0.000 setrgbcolor AdjustColor
0 175 146 [
[(The transaction takes place in zero time--i.e.,)]
[(if you tried to use [timer] to measure the time)]
[(delay between the two, you would get zero.)]
] 14 -0 0 0 false DrawText
